  "id": "superstitious-behavior",
  "term": "superstitious behavior",
  "definition": "Superstitious behavior is action a person uses to feel some control over uncertain events. In sports settings, it can help fans or athletes feel that their actions affect the outcome and can lessen the uncertainty and stress tied to not knowing what will happen.",
